  voiceVolume: 1
  bedVolume: 0.25
  bedIntroVolume: 0.7
  loopBed: 0
  voiceDelay: 2.5
  newsScript: 'Good evening. We interrupt our programming with breaking news. Over
    the past few hours, coffins have been appearing throughout the city: in alleyways,
    in parks, and in the middle of our streets. No one has claimed responsibility.
    Tonight, police received an anonymous warning about what the sender calls a vampire,
    a creature that stays alive by biting people to death. Authorities are urging
    residents to stay indoors and to report anything unusual. We will bring you more
    on this story as it develops.'
